{"license":"CC-BY-NC-4.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Hebrew Text Database ETCBC4b"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ETCBC4b"}},{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:62732"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"W.T. van Peursen"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Eep Talstra Centre for Bible And Computing, VU University Amsterdam"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"C. Sikkel"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Eep Talstra Centre for Bible And Computing, VU University Amsterdam"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"D. Roorda"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Data Archiving and Networked Services, Royal Netherlands Academy of Arts and Sciences"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"W.T. van Peursen"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"VU University, Faculty of Theology"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>The ETCBC database of the Hebrew Bible, contains the scholarly text of the Hebrew Bible with linguistic markup.<br>A previous version, Hebrew Text Database ETCBC4, can be found in EASY (see the link below). See the description there for more details.<\/p><p>The present dataset is a new version:<\/p><p>(A) the content has been updated, all features have been filled in for all objects whenever applicable;<br>(B) not all feature values have been checked; for that we have to wait for version 4c.<\/p><p>The reason to submit this version now is the upcoming Annual Meeting of the Society of Biblical Literature (November 21-24, 2015, Atlanta).<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ancient Hebrew"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Text Databases"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Linguistic Annotation Framework"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["English","Hebrew (modern)"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2015-11-03"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"E. Talstra (Eep Talstra Centre for Bible And Computing, VU University Amsterdam)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"J. Dyk (Eep Talstra Centre for Bible And Computing, VU University Amsterdam)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"O. Glanz (Seventh-day Adventist Theological Seminary, Andrews University Berrien Springs, Michigan)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"R. Oosting (Nederlands Bijbelgenootschap)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"G. Kalkman (Eep Talstra Centre for Bible And Computing, VU University Amsterdam)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2015-11-16"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2015-11-05"},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["The ETCBC4b text is based on the printed edition of the Biblia Hebraica Stuttgartensia, editio quinta emendata (1997).\nThis edition, published by the German Bible Society, represents the text found in the oldest complete manuscript of the Hebrew Bible \/ Old Testament, the so-called Codex Leningradensis (Codex Firkovich B 19 A).\nAlthough it cannot be taken for granted that this manuscript, and hence the scholarly edition that represents it, always contains the best (“original”) reading and although we have older manuscripts for various parts of the Bible (Dead Sea Scrolls, some other codices that cover only part of the Hebrew Bible), taking this edition as basis for the electronic text was a natural step because of its central role as *the* scholarly edition of the Old Testament that is almost exclusively used by biblical scholars and that is the basis for almost all Bible translations in modern languages as far as they translate the Hebrew text.\n\nThe linguistic features of ETCBC4b have been provided by the Eep Talstra Centre for Bible and Computing.\nAt the moment of depositing, this version is still in beta.\nThe data deposited is the newest data that was available at the date of depositing.\n\nThis LAF resource has been generated from the contents of an Emdros database\n\nHowever, not all data that the ETCBC group is producing, is published in this form.\nWe have made a selection of some extra data, and have added that as an extra LAF annotation file, which can be used in conjunction with the LAF resource originating from the Emdros database.\nWe refer to the ETCBC organization on Github for more examples of work done on with LAF-Fabric operating on ETCBC4."]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Eep Talstra Centre for Bible And Computing - VU University Amsterdam"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["English"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34100","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D36900","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D33000"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34100","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"Antiquity"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Oudheid"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D36900","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"Language and literature studies of other language groups"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Taal- en letterkunde overige taalgroepen"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D33000","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"Theology and religious studies"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Godgeleerdheid en religiewetenschappen"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"}]},{"typeName":"dansCollection","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","